,"title":"Save image: octave 2 4992x7296","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.27.0"},"widgets_values":["portrait_octave2"]},{"id":41,"type":"Note","pos":[3180,76],"size":[520,260],"flags":{},"order":4,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Notes - Loaders","properties":{},"widgets_values":["Checkpoint feeds BOTH the base render and every octave refiner,\nso swapping it changes skin character all the way up the ladder.\n\nMeasured 2026-08-18, same seed, same prompt:\n  RealVisXL V5    real pore structure, freckles sit IN the skin\n  Juggernaut XI   freckles painted on a smooth plastic gradient\n  CyberRealistic  waxy nose, smooth between the freckles\n\nUpscale model is 4xNomos8kDAT, NOT 4x-UltraSharpV2. UltraSharp\netches dark speckle into skin and that artifact COMPOUNDS once\nper octave. Nomos is softer per pass; the refiners put the\ndetail back."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":42,"type":"Note","pos":[3180,516],"size":[520,559.5625],"flags":{},"order":5,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Notes - Base render 1248x1824","properties":{},"widgets_values":["832x1216 portrait, not landscape: it puts the pixels on the face.\nBoth axes must stay multiples of 8 or the tiled VAE silently\ncrops them.\n\nThe hires fix pass reuses the SAME prompt as the base pass on\npurpose. It is a resolution fix, not a second idea.\n\nSeed is fixed so a change to any octave can be judged against a\nconstant base. Unfix it only once the ladder above is settled."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":43,"type":"Note","pos":[3180,1255.578125],"size":[520,559.5625],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Notes - Octave 1 to 2496x3648","properties":{},"widgets_values":["TO DISABLE THIS OCTAVE: select the band, Ctrl+M.\nDISABLE FROM THE TOP DOWN AND NEVER LEAVE A HOLE. Each octave\neats the previous octave's decoded image, so muting a middle\nband ERRORS the band above it.\n\nThis prompt names NO SUBJECT, only texture. At refine scale one\ntile is a patch of cheek, and a prompt reading 'portrait of a\nwoman' will grow a SECOND FACE inside it. The refine negative\ncarries duplicate face / second face / extra eye for the same\nreason.\n\nEvery rung is exactly 2x. That is the design, not a coincidence:\none refine pass at low denoise cannot cross a bigger gap without\ngoing to mush.\n\nControlNet end_percent is 0.8, so guidance releases for the last\n20% of steps and the model is free to add detail. Taking it to\n1.0 locks the texture out."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":44,"type":"Note","pos":[3180,1995.15625],"size":[520,559.5625],"flags":{},"order":7,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Notes - Octave 2 to 4992x7296","properties":{},"widgets_values":["TO DISABLE THIS OCTAVE: select the band, Ctrl+M.\nSHIPS MUTED. Enable for 36 MP. Measured 389 s on a 4090.\n\nThis is the top of the ladder and the last rung that pays for\nitself.\n\nVRAM FALLS AS RESOLUTION RISES. Measured peak: base pass 16.9 GB,\noctave 1 16.1 GB, octave 2 15.4 GB. The octaves are tiled so they\ncap out; the un-tiled hires fix in band 2 is the binding\nconstraint. If the base render fits your card, every octave fits.\n\nA third octave was built and cut. At 2.8x it went BACKWARDS:\neyelashes went soft, skin grew mottling that was not there, and\ntexture appeared in the BOKEH, where by definition there should\nbe none.\n\nCause: at that scale a tile covers about 0.5% of the frame, so\nmost tiles hold no structure at all, and a texture prompt with\nnothing to reinforce invents instead. Not fixable by prompting,\nbecause the prompt cannot know a tile is background.\n\nHigh-frequency energy still measured x1.5 to x2.0 HIGHER at that\noctave, which is why the metric cannot arbitrate here. It counts\ninvented grain as detail. The eye decides. See the notes file."],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[1,3,0,4,0,"CONTROL_NET"],[2,1,1,5,0,"CLIP"],[3,1,1,6,0,"CLIP"],[4,1,1,7,0,"CLIP"],[5,1,0,9,0,"MODEL"],[6,6,0,9,1,"CONDITIONING"],[7,7,0,9,2,"CONDITIONING"],[8,8,0,9,3,"LATENT"],[9,9,0,10,0,"LATENT"],[10,1,0,11,0,"MODEL"],[11,6,0,11,1,"CONDITIONING"],[12,7,0,11,2,"CONDITIONING"],[13,10,0,11,3,"LATENT"],[14,11,0,12,0,"LATENT"],[15,1,2,12,1,"VAE"],[16,12,0,13,0,"IMAGE"],[17,2,0,14,0,"UPSCALE_MODEL"],[18,12,0,14,1,"IMAGE"],[19,14,0,15,0,"IMAGE"],[20,1,1,16,0,"CLIP"],[21,16,0,17,0,"CONDITIONING"],[22,5,0,17,1,"CONDITIONING"],[23,4,0,17,2,"CONTROL_NET"],[24,15,0,17,3,"IMAGE"],[25,1,2,17,4,"VAE"],[26,1,0,18,0,"MODEL"],[27,15,0,19,0,"IMAGE"],[28,1,2,19,1,"VAE"],[29,18,0,20,0,"MODEL"],[30,19,0,20,3,"LATENT"],[31,17,0,20,1,"CONDITIONING"],[32,17,1,20,2,"CONDITIONING"],[33,20,0,21,0,"LATENT"],[34,1,2,21,1,"VAE"],[35,21,0,22,0,"IMAGE"],[36,2,0,23,0,"UPSCALE_MODEL"],[37,21,0,23,1,"IMAGE"],[38,23,0,24,0,"IMAGE"],[39,1,1,25,0,"CLIP"],[40,25,0,26,0,"CONDITIONING"],[41,5,0,26,1,"CONDITIONING"],[42,4,0,26,2,"CONTROL_NET"],[43,24,0,26,3,"IMAGE"],[44,1,2,26,4,"VAE"],[45,1,0,27,0,"MODEL"],[46,24,0,28,0,"IMAGE"],[47,1,2,28,1,"VAE"],[48,27,0,29,0,"MODEL"],[49,28,0,29,3,"LATENT"],[50,26,0,29,1,"CONDITIONING"],[51,26,1,29,2,"CONDITIONING"],[52,29,0,30,0,"LATENT"],[53,1,2,30,1,"VAE"],[54,30,0,31,0,"IMAGE"]],"groups":[{"id":1,"title":"1 - Loaders","bounding":[0,0,3740,370],"color":"#3f5159","flags":{}},{"id":2,"title":"2 - Base render 1248x1824","bounding":[0,440,3740,669.578125],"color":"#3f5f4f","flags":{}},{"id":3,"title":"3 - Octave 1 to 2496x3648","bounding":[0,1179.578125,3740,669.578125],"color":"#5f5f3f","flags":{}},{"id":4,"title":"4 - Octave 2 to 4992x7296","bounding":[0,1919.15625,3740,669.578125],"color":"#5f4030","flags":{}}],"config":{},"extra":{"ds":{"scale":0.38554328942953164,"offset":[-110.31051778384335,302.324696248151]}},"version":0.4}